<svg aria-hidden="true" width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute;overflow:hidden"><defs>
<symbol id="i-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14"/></symbol><symbol id="i-box" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m3 7 9-5 9 5v10l-9 5-9-5Zm0 0 9 5 9-5M12 12v10M7.5 4.5l9 5v5"/></symbol><symbol id="i-return" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5 3 10l5 5M3 10h11a5 5 0 0 1 0 10h-3M15 3h6v10"/></symbol><symbol id="i-shield" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m12 2 9 4v6c0 5-9 10-9 10S3 17 3 12V6ZM8 12l3 3 5-6"/></symbol><symbol id="i-truck" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 5h11v12H3Zm11 5h4l3 4v3h-7M1 9h6M1 12h4"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2"/></symbol><symbol id="i-headset" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 13v-2a9 9 0 0 1 18 0v2M5 11H3v7h4v-7Zm14 0h2v7h-4v-7ZM20 18c0 4-5 4-7 4"/></symbol><symbol id="i-film" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="1"/><path d="m10 8 6 4-6 4ZM3 8h3M3 16h3M18 8h3M18 16h3"/></symbol>
</defs></svg>
<header class="site-header" id="siteHeader"><div class="container nav-shell"><button class="wordmark" data-route="home" aria-label="Palm X 首页，字标暂用文字占位">Palm <b>X</b></button><nav class="nav" aria-label="主导航"><button class="nav-btn" data-menu="products" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mega">Products</button><button class="nav-btn" data-menu="software" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mega">Software</button><button class="nav-btn" data-menu="space" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mega">Palmx Space</button><button class="nav-btn" data-menu="community" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mega">Community</button><button class="nav-btn" data-menu="explore" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mega">Explore</button><button class="nav-btn" data-menu="support" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mega">Support</button></nav><div class="header-tail"><span class="review-pill">DRAFT / 01</span><button class="text-link header-cta" data-detail="reseller"><span>Become to reseller</span><span>↗</span></button><button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" aria-label="展开网站导航" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobileNav"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 7h18M3 12h18M3 17h18"/></svg></button></div></div></header>
<div class="nav-scrim" id="navScrim" hidden></div><section class="mega" id="mega" aria-label="导航展开内容" hidden><div class="container mega-inner" id="megaInner"></div></section><nav class="mobile-drawer" id="mobileNav" aria-label="移动端导航" hidden></nav>
<div id="home">
<div style="position:relative"><div id="banner-root"></div><a class="text-link banner-skip" href="#proof"><span>继续浏览官网</span><span>↓</span></a></div>
<main id="mainContent">
<section class="section proof" id="proof"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">01 / PROOF</div><h2 class="section-title" lang="en">Made here.<br>Made real.</h2></div><div><p>从一段加工过程，到一件真实作品。<br>让每个想法，都有看得见的结果。</p><div class="section-controls" style="margin-top:22px"><button class="arrow-btn" id="proofPrev" aria-label="上一个案例">←</button><button class="arrow-btn" id="proofNext" aria-label="下一个案例">→</button></div></div></div>
<div class="proof-track" id="proofTrack">
<button class="project-card" data-film="workspace"><div class="project-media"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="已上传镜头中的金属几何零件，非真实加工证据" loading="lazy"><span class="asset-tag">已提供概念镜头</span><span class="play-icon" aria-hidden="true">▶</span></div><div class="project-body"><div class="meta"><span>PROCESS STUDY</span><span>01</span></div><h3>从屏幕，进入加工空间。</h3><p>观看现有镜头，讨论数字与现实的衔接。</p></div></button>
<button class="project-card" data-film="structure"><div class="project-media"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="v57 模型轴体结构预览" loading="lazy"><span class="asset-tag">研发模型预览</span><span class="play-icon" aria-hidden="true">▶</span></div><div class="project-body"><div class="meta"><span>PRODUCT EXPLORATION</span><span>02</span></div><h3>精密，藏在每一个细节里。</h3><p>回看当前模型的内部结构与镜头路径。</p></div></button>
<button class="project-card" data-route="space"><div class="project-media"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="内部结构画面，仅作社区案例封面占位" loading="lazy"><span class="asset-tag">社区精选内容待接入</span><span class="play-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="project-body"><div class="meta"><span>FROM PALMX SPACE</span><span>03</span></div><h3>你的下一件作品，会是什么？</h3><p>前往自有社区入口，预览内容呈现方式。</p></div></button>
</div><div class="section-note"><p>评审说明：以上使用现有模型和概念镜头验证封面与播放交互，尚非用户作品或第三方实拍；正式 Proof 将替换为授权案例。</p><button class="text-link" data-route="space"><span>探索 Palmx Space</span><span>↗</span></button></div></div></section>
<section class="section discover" id="discover"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">02 / DISCOVER</div><h2 class="section-title" lang="en">Your space.<br>Your possibilities.</h2></div><p>在不同的创作场景中，<br>找到属于你的制造方式。</p></div><div class="scenario-grid" id="scenarioGrid"></div><p class="fine" style="margin-top:22px">场景图暂以现有产品素材合成占位；应用范围与真实使用照片待确认。</p></div></section>
<section class="section material-intro" id="materialsTitle"><div class="container"><div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:0"><div><div class="eyebrow">03 / MATERIALS</div><h2 class="section-title" lang="en">From material<br>to object.</h2></div><p>选择一种材料，探索一件立体作品。<br>滚动，让屏幕里的想法进入真实空间。</p></div></div></section>
<section class="material-track" id="materials"><div class="material-stage" id="materialStage"><div class="material-bg"><video id="materialVideo" src="data:video/mp4;base64,